# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client data and secrets — the entries that actually matter
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The dev email sink contains magic links (PLAN.md §4). The storage root contains uploaded client
# documents. Neither may ever reach the repository. These are ignored before the app exists, so a
# first run cannot commit them by accident. Phase 0b pins the exact paths in configuration; keep
# them inside one of the folders below.
.local/
**/.local/
dev-sink/
**/dev-sink/
uploads/
**/uploads/

# SQLite database and its journals.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Local configuration and secrets. User secrets live outside the repo by design; these patterns
# are a backstop against a stray file.
*.local.json
appsettings.*.Local.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pfx
*.p12
*.pem
*.key

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .NET
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
artifacts/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
.vs/
TestResults/
coverage*.xml
coverage*.json
*.coverage
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Node / Vite
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo
coverage/
.vercel/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Claude Code
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
